{
 "encounter_id": "00706",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, hello, doctor. Gosh, it's the scar, you see, it's been months and it still hurts, and it's right where my skirt rubs, and I told my daughter, she's getting married in June, a lovely lad, a plumber..."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Congratulations to her. Which scar, Margaret, remind me? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The hip. The new hip, four months ago, on the left. The pain around the scar, it's like a burning, and a bit numb on the side."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has the burning been there?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Since about a month after the operation, so, three months, nearly? Though I had the tingling in January too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the numb patch, is that the same area?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, just on the outside of the thigh. Oh, and the hip itself is stiff in the mornings, I can't get my tights on."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever or sweats?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no fever at all. I took my temperature, I've got that thermometer you put in your ear."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any discharge, any weeping from the scar?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nothing like that, it's dry as a bone."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tramadol, 50 mg, twice a day. Paracetamol, 1 gram, four times. Lansoprazole, 30 mg, in the morning, for my stomach, and levothyroxine, 75 micrograms, first thing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. Iodine. I react, they put it on my wristband at the hospital, but I can never remember what it does to me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's fine, we'll note iodine. What conditions do you have?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Underactive thyroid, acid reflux, and the thin bones, osteoporosis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations apart from the hip?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The hip, four months ago, and my cataract in 2019, the left eye."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any bone problems in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother broke her hip when she was eighty."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What did you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I was a nurse, retired now. Thirty-five years on the wards."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Where do you live?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A second-floor flat, no lift, so the stairs are a battle."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And have you been doing the exercises?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The physio ones, yes, every morning, apart from when it hurts too much."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me do your numbers. Pulse 72, blood pressure 138 over 84, temperature 36.8, oxygen 97 percent, breathing 16, weight 64 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that all right? Oh, my daughter's fiancé fixed our boiler last year, that's how they met. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Lovely. Let's look at the scar.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mind the skirt. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The scar is healed and dry, with no redness or swelling. But the skin along it is very tender to light touch."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, that's the burning, even the sheet bothers me. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any problem with your chest or breathing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing, I'm fine in that department."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The scar looks healed, and I think this is irritation of a small skin nerve, which is common after hip surgery, but I can't completely rule out a deep infection."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh dear, is it infected? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I doubt it, but I'd like to check. I'd like to arrange an X-ray of the hip, and blood tests for inflammation and infection markers."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Can I carry on with the exercises? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes. I'd also like to do an ultrasound scan around the scar, and a bone density scan, since you have osteoporosis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When would that be? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The bone scan can wait a few weeks. I'd like to see you again in two weeks with the results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two weeks. I'll put it on the fridge. ~"
  }
 ],
